---
import Section from "../layout/Section.astro";
import Container from "../layout/Container.astro";
---

<Section>

  <Container>

    <header class="section-header">

      <h2>Funding</h2>

      <p>
        The NeuroTopology Group is supported through competitive research
        funding.
      </p>

    </header>

<div class="funding-content">

  <div class="funding-card">

    <h3>
      UK Research and Innovation (UKRI)
    </h3>

    <p>

      The project "Algebraic topology bridging the gap between single neurons and networks" is funded by Medical Research Council (MRC) from UKRI. 

    </p>

    <a
      href="https://gtr.ukri.org/projects?ref=MR%2FZ504804%2F1"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >

      View funded project →

    </a>

  </div>

</div>

  </Container>

</Section>